sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Employee
    participant Product as Mesa Tica
    Employee->>Product: Choose permitted next status
    alt Cancel order
    Product-->>Employee: Request reason and final confirmation, reason is customer-visible
    Employee->>Product: Enter reason and confirm or dismiss
    end
    alt Stale action or another employee changed the order
    Product-->>Employee: Reject change, show current state, no automatic retry
    Employee->>Product: Deliberately choose a still-valid action after review
    else Invalid transition or missing cancellation reason
    Product-->>Employee: Explain correction, leave order unchanged
    else Valid authorized change
    Product-->>Employee: Confirm current status, record employee and time
    end
    Note over Employee,Product: Collected and Cancelled are final. Uncertain outcomes are refreshed before another deliberate action.
